\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The six-cycle numbers}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{For the six-cycle of \ref{fdip-0057}, the diagonal value is #{3} and the
neighbor value is #{1}, so the shape #{a/(2b)} equals #{3/2}.
The retained matrix has diagonal #{7/3} and neighbor value
#{1/3}. Two polynomials, defined next, are used for the new
shape and for the determinant of each eliminated path.}
